-- covers: 487.07(2)(b)
-- jural: a peace officer > the person from whom the samples are to be taken > power
@ref s 487.07(2)(b) (src:9688-9690)
GIVEN `the person is a person from whom samples of bodily substances are to be taken` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 487.07(2)(b) the person may be required to accompany a peace officer for the purpose of taking the samples` MEANS
    IF `the person is a person from whom samples of bodily substances are to be taken`
    THEN JUST TRUE
