        IF NOT `samples are to be taken under an order made under section 487.051 or an authorization granted under section 487.055 or 487.091` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)
        IF `the person’s DNA profile is in the convicted offenders index of the national DNA data bank` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "If the person’s DNA profile is in the convicted offenders index of the national DNA data bank, the peace officer or person acting under their direction shall not take any bodily substances from the person"

